    {
      "id": "4B5B68B8C11CA404",
      "title": "Continue from QAV workshop",
      "subtitle": "QAV → IMV",
      "description": [
        "\"The front-end chassis is ready. This chapter continues to connect the main materials, electronics and facilities to create the first batch of IMV mechanical cubes.\"",
        "\"First connect the main material production line, and then arrange the merging process after recycling and boosting. Please check JEI for materials, power and working conditions.\""
      ],
