      "id": "4B51E08379C2635B",
      "title": "Imaginary topology printed circuit board",
      "subtitle": "Line development is done separately",
      "description": [
        "\"Send the laminated substrate to a chemical dipping machine for development, and take out the waste etching solution outlet. After the printed circuit is completed, install the patch array and phase interface chip.\""
      ],
      "dependencies": [
        "4B5D8A011ADB9399"
