      "title": "Imaginary topology epitaxial wafer",
      "subtitle": "Leave an extended surface for the new workspace",
      "description": [
        "\"A thin layer of ceramic and dielectric film are laid on the wafer, with the front platform logic die reserved for readout. The epitaxial wafer is then branched off to logic exposure and memory imprinting.\""
      ],
