      "title": "Imaginary topology logic wafer",
      "subtitle": "Use masks to determine logical shapes",
      "description": [
        "\"Expose the epitaxial wafer to form an imaginary topology logic wafer. The photolithography mask is left as a tool, and the finished product continues to be sent for cutting.\""
