      "title": "Imaginary topology logic die",
      "subtitle": "Eight die are cut from each wafer",
      "description": [
        "\"Cut the logic wafer into die and route the hot coolant back to the existing coolant conditioning line. The die will go into this level of CPU packaging.\""
      ],
