      "title": "Imaginary topology chip capacitor",
      "subtitle": "Prepare capacitors for local power supply",
      "description": [
        "\"Connect the quantum coherent capacitor with the same-level interconnection network and isolation film, and then encapsulate the ceramic working surface. These capacitors are used for energy storage and filtering of the imaginary topology function array.\""
      ],
